<description>&lt;p&gt;Gangs attacked inmates in two Ecuadorian prisons, killing eight and wounding ten. The government placed former candidate Luisa González in preventive detention on alleged money-laundering charges. President Noboa has intensified militarization and political repression as the country aligns with external security interests. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9Jd25KMmYyd0FQWWFNVmljUmNSYmMwbFhCMlpnRnJ3M2lBUE5qamYxWk9KNHhVSlZaM19mU2txQzJfcXhUS3NhX0NEM25NUVdDM0JUVGVjajhaUC1mUno5ZTBjSXhTcGxtcE1kWlBmcjM4bHFEeHBqdTdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;teleSUR English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPYnNWWF9IMnVLc0tPYy1iT2xfbFE1cElNMnMxcWNsWUV2VUhabFo1VDFLUERtX2xnd1A4VS1ZSDdNbDdnRzdaYnlhY3Vqb19PQWpxd29PVDVVLXVwUVBfbGlrUFBBX2htOTB6NDFSbzNNYXg4WVlfLTZFdm8wb2JNWXlXZ3JfMWZMeUNIaDFsMlpkeUVQa2ZBb1lHTTN6YzlZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wonderwall&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNb1JFS3I2ZDZ5VjNiOXhoTFBfZnIzeU1EdVlVbFpfM0gtbTFscEtzMlhSeVU3QXdkNDJGclZTV3Y2TThmNkU3VU1TbEtuZFd2Ynh2eHd3QllBckpVNWU2dDVqRjJ6Z1V5MGt5QTdjVmE2TS1mVkozS2ZBLU5KckFmV2RRMm4zTU05X0xJS2R1NF94Ulg5LW5PYlYyXzU0NVNZVVFremJwa1EwOHJQZk1zTzhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE9TaVMzMVZlRUR5WHZycUZyOXNvNjdpUnZQSWsxNWpoaFdrN3F2T0xCaTMzMkR4WElwOHJhX2Nlb2FDa2RvZkk4aWVLRnhqWFViVm1MbVAtUnczOXVVOXRqZkNZblROcTdURVZ2Tzl3TGgxWXNOZDlnR3dpZDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Xinhua&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQT3Q2bG1WM3VpYkh4WXhRUi1HWGR6X1FGNjNyRjhQQnBmS1RDdlFHUkJLTG5jeGw3WVg1ZGZOa1psOUppZWh4alpkeFZLbkJXVTlILTRxekw5RE1Uai1vX0VxU2pTM